{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The GE AC44C6M is an AC-traction 4,400-horsepower (3,300 kW) diesel locomotive, rebuilt from GE Transportation Dash 9 locomotives. AC44C6M rebuilds have been done by GE (now Wabtec), American Motive Power, Inc., and Norfolk Southern Railway's Juniata and Roanoke Shops, starting in September 2015. The AC44C6M retains the 16-cylinder 7FDL-16 prime mover used in the core locomotive prior to rebuilding, but replaces the Dash 9's DC traction motors with alternating current GE 5GEB13B7 traction motors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This dlc features the following liveries:<br><br>- NS 4000 Blue Mane 2 AC44C6M<br>- NS 4002 Red Mane 1 AC44C6M<br>- NS 4004 Blue Mane 1 AC44C6M<br>- NS 8520 Red Mane 2 AC44C6M<br>- NS 4822 Railfans AC44C6M<br>- NS 4851 TAG AC44C6M</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- animated drivers cabin<br>- animated wipers<br>- ACS coupling supported<br>- running numbers<br>- animated fans<br>- custom head and ditchlight<br>- weathering skins<br>- fuel consumption<br>- dynamic weathering<br>- deadman's control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437760?t=1741244482","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3437760?t=1741244482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437760/e9d14b50c7ab7daaa41a747a3c3824dafc688f7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741244482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437760/e9d14b50c7ab7daaa41a747a3c3824dafc688f7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741244482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes leve